  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:290px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-darkgreen pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Radiation Conversion</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/3/31/Radioactive_Man.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20191007073917\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Radioactive Man\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/3/31/Radioactive_Man.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20191007073917\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/3/31/Radioactive_Man.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20191007073917 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/3/31/Radioactive_Man.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20191007073917 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Radioactive Man\" width=\"270\" height=\"410\" data-image-key=\"Radioactive_Man.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Radioactive Man.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Radioactive Man (Marvel Comics) can absorb and convert different radiological energies along the EM Spectrum.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb and convert radiation</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div> \n<p>The power to <b>absorb radiation and convert it to other forms of energy</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Radiation_Manipulation\" title=\"Radiation Manipulation\">Radiation Manipulation</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Radiation_Absorption\" title=\"Radiation Absorption\">Radiation Absorption</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Energy Conversion\">Energy Conversion</a>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Variations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Variations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Objects\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Objects</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlis